| Filename | Overview |
|----------|----------|
| apps/renderer/src/components/projects-sidebar.tsx | Integrates grouped sidebar rendering and controls, but the empty-group invitation is not itself a drop target. |
| apps/renderer/src/lib/use-sidebar-organize.ts | Implements native drag/drop state and target calculation; nested project rows incorrectly advertise unsupported group drops. |
| apps/renderer/src/lib/sidebar-project-layout.ts | Defines layout parsing and mutations, including explicit rejection of group-to-group-internal targets exposed by the drag hook. |
| apps/renderer/src/store/sidebar-project-layout.ts | Adds guarded localStorage persistence and atom-store actions for sidebar layouts. |
| apps/renderer/test/unit/sidebar-project-layout.test.ts | Covers core layout behavior but not the drag-handler target mismatch or empty-group interaction. |
| apps/renderer/vite.config.ts | Deduplicates React runtimes and includes react-dom in dependency optimization. |
| apps/renderer/src/lib/sidebar-project-icon.ts | Defines validated group icon color identifiers and Tailwind style mappings. |

</details>


